request:
a put on one member, then a range for the same key on another

m1 POST /v3/kv/put  write through m1
    {"key":"cmVwbGljYXRlZA==","value":"eWVz"}
m3 POST /v3/kv/range  and read it on m3
    {"key":"cmVwbGljYXRlZA=="}

response:
the value the put wrote, with the revision the put answered with

m1 200 OK
    {"header":{"cluster_id":"797335041246534418","member_id":"14633748864182199272","revision":"2","raft_term":"2"}}
m3 200 OK
    {"header":{"cluster_id":"797335041246534418","member_id":"11053797028375956342","revision":"2","raft_term":"2"},"kvs":[{"key":"cmVwbGljYXRlZA==","create_revision":"2","mod_revision":"2","version":"1","value":"eWVz"}],"count":"1"}

request:
a put sent to a member that is not the leader

m2 POST /v3/kv/put  write through m2, which is usually not the leader
    {"key":"dGhyb3VnaC1tMg==","value":"Zm9yd2FyZGVk"}
m1 POST /v3/kv/range  read it back on m1
    {"key":"dGhyb3VnaC1tMg=="}
m3 POST /v3/kv/range  and on m3
    {"key":"dGhyb3VnaC1tMg=="}

response:
a normal put response, and the key readable on all three members

m2 200 OK
    {"header":{"cluster_id":"797335041246534418","member_id":"11719854504675190793","revision":"3","raft_term":"2"}}
m1 200 OK
    {"header":{"cluster_id":"797335041246534418","member_id":"14633748864182199272","revision":"3","raft_term":"2"},"kvs":[{"key":"dGhyb3VnaC1tMg==","create_revision":"3","mod_revision":"3","version":"1","value":"Zm9yd2FyZGVk"}],"count":"1"}
m3 200 OK
    {"header":{"cluster_id":"797335041246534418","member_id":"11053797028375956342","revision":"3","raft_term":"2"},"kvs":[{"key":"dGhyb3VnaC1tMg==","create_revision":"3","mod_revision":"3","version":"1","value":"Zm9yd2FyZGVk"}],"count":"1"}
